  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/rab/301",
  "definition": "Application",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-07-16",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rab 100) #5435, eff 7-15-92; ss by #6787, INTERIM, eff 7-15-98, EXPIRED: 11-12-98 New. #6958, eff 3-23-99, EXPIRED: 3-23-07 New. #8854, INTERIM, eff 3-24-07, EXPIRED: 9-20-07 New. #9018, eff 11-1-07; ss by #10270, eff 2-2-13, EXPIRED: 2-2-23 New. #13967, eff 7-16-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rab 300)",
